               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "maybe replace other threads in Logger with use of IntervalTimer and just a dependency that you must startup interval timer before logger mgr. OR – allow nested starters? And have logMgr silently start it. That might be tter for stuff that can be started without options.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "       MAYBE pattern for module starters is no-arg starters/acitivators can be done nested, but ones with OPTIONS MUST be done first!",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "       @todo carefully consider how nested activators would work – take optional arg to other activator so can be suppressed? Or allow nesting (but how to handle both specifying options – nested activators cannot specify them? Or first wins or last wins?).",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
